{
  "format": "story-pages-v1",
  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukong-and-the-snowy-zigzags-v5.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "b456b6cfba423cd8ec11e71cc9672b1a78ac043d8df7044116fd2c491d1f3d19",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "be6ecc8bd344a50eccbc97dfadb1bfaae03aedddb577f40e9da6a2f2709596eb",
      "text": "Wukong and the\nSnowy Zigzags",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "90dc379c10c8e9d8cf6aabc4d9c644499192b0989b28e334cfe596aaa1b9e02f",
      "text": "Jade Rabbit waved.\n“Welcome, Wukong!”\n“Welcome, Princess Iron Fan!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "78587d6b3f44455226520f1976b987fdf08fb5f8068914d171535650ea573d6f",
      "text": "Gold staff. Silver fan.\nThey tucked them in the cubby.\nBoots on. Skis ready.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "5de0740a0439803ed7243089e367fb26e5aa313bf5cf39c37cc67c6e0804e9e8",
      "text": "“My feet got long!” Wukong\nwobbled. His skis slid apart.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "10ace158db80ebb61b92343945e32de32a3d1e0a8ea3ee24f9880b1ed21dd54c",
      "text": "Coach Otter checked each\nhelmet. “Stay on the beginner\nhill.” They listened.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d9d7f50a9fc743125e1c7a4a515f828bee775576e9fc67cd7081abc666a32d6e",
      "text": "Wukong stepped too fast.\nPlop! A soft snow sit.\nHis tail wore a snowball.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ba431d1116e2d29896a02c035c48de16d76cf2dadd3deda39e1b7a147ce34057",
      "text": "Iron Fan sat in soft snow. “A\nroyal snow cushion!” she laughed.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a026b0c11a65db804b533365cf0e57a83548f4a5d5a26a2fb820ccfef3ab42e5",
      "text": "She stopped with a swish.\nThen she looked at the\nturn. It felt too big.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "70c7c2fd42a93e1e9a239c67cea394249004ab257e72fb55d4a098e0ac731dd0",
      "text": "Wukong bent his knees. “Easy,\nfeet!” He looked down the hill.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "e26a37828e3e11b5151060d939f104ebef6390a5a84569b3a2a99e21332eb233",
      "text": "Coach made a wide flag path.\nJade cheered from the side:\n“Take your time!”\nWukong listened.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d2b4dc5d376801b29030fa54b827b33ac5d72a796f5d5a54b18f4091e7a2775e",
      "text": "Iron Fan breathed out. A little\nbend. A little turn. Her skis\ncurved around the flag.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "2566a7f076e3de62311bb4ee0dafb90a5d75fbbf1ceb3518391997fe3b442520",
      "text": "Wukong bent, then turned.\n“Slow. Turn. Stop.”\nHe stopped by the flag.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "1a84e02b7a6dc74c8bdfdd2a822d27297839cde6904d2d77e400a8d90f0ce0a2",
      "text": "They looked back. Two wiggly\ntracks crossed the snow. “Two\nsnowy ribbons!” cried Jade.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "af15a90f288695611bb930c9be637063235d0e2ef128839d70b49e0848743c5e",
      "text": "Three mugs of warm cocoa. A\nbowl of fish crackers. They\nblew gently. Sip, sip.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "2d4c9c6d86f449bc81de0f33327644eb7d557fdd44d253d4664cc9fdbab21414",
      "text": "“My fish can’t ski!” “Mine can\nswim... in my tummy!” Crunch,\ncrunch.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "0256d56ffbb33f661753d10124660c18fdf567623a68b8a365547b92168cee98",
      "text": "They drew their zigzag routes.\nJade added tiny snowflakes.\nOutside, snow fell softly.\nInside, the cocoa stayed warm.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "6b94c8febe5feb6a7e982144d0c240be01010efc5f336537724b56e5cfcd50ae",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\nThank you for reading!\nWe hope you and your little reader\nenjoyed this little adventure.\nMore free stories\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends\nRead, download and print - always free.\nRead more free stories\nIf you enjoyed our stories, you are welcome\nto help the next one grow. Support is optional.\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nCreated by Peihong Guo\nStories and illustrations made with AI assistance and human editing.",
